-+- SN User-o-Meter v1.3R Screen Shots -+-

Well, I forgot to include the screen shots of the registered version like
I said I was going to do.  Oh well.  Here they are...

ALAS_Cfg1.IFF    -  Shows the ALAS config addition to the main config
                    screen.

ALAS_Cfg2.IFF    -  The screen for configuring ALAS's level evaluation
                    routines.

ALAS_Eval.IFF    -  Shows what users see when they're being evaluated.

Tools_Cfg.IFF    -  First screen you come to when you enter Tools.  You
                    configure your scan from here.

Tools_Scan.IFF   -  This is what it looks like while its scanning the
                    user database.

Tools_SDone.IFF  -  These are the options you get once the scan is done.

Tools_Rpt.IFF    -  Here's what the output looks like!


